    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21074" root="سهل" body-key="s">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استهل</span></b> , of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِفْتَعَلَ</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّهْلُ</span>,
occurs in a trad., where it is said, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْ كَذَبَ عَلَىَّ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَقَدِ ٱسْتَهَلَ مَكَانَهُ فِى جَهَنَّمَ</span>, meaning [<i>He who lies
against me</i>] <i>takes for himself easily his place of
abode in Hell.</i> (TA.)

